  "surface_notes": {
    "notebookutils.env": [
      "NOT A DOCUMENTED MODULE, and the previous scope list was wrong to name",
      "one. The overview page's module table has eight namespaces and `env` is",
      "not among them; what it used to answer (workspace id, lakehouse id) are",
      "keys on `notebookutils.runtime.context`. It is an mssparkutils-era",
      "holdover that this shim still ships. Keeping it is harmless -- contract 2",
      "allows extra surface -- but it must not be counted as parity, and nothing",
      "should be built against it."
    ],
    "mssparkutils": [
      "The legacy alias. The overview page states the rename is complete, that",
      "existing code stays backward compatible, and that the namespace WILL BE",
      "RETIRED. It has its own page (microsoft-spark-utilities) which is not",
      "transcribed here: emulating a namespace Microsoft is retiring is a",
      "different decision from emulating the current one, and it should be made",
      "deliberately rather than by transcription. This tree ships no",
      "`mssparkutils` module at all today."
    ],
    "language_variants": [
      "Signatures here are the PYTHON spelling. The pages note that Scala uses",
      "camelCase for some parameters (`createPath` for `create_path`,",
      "`maxBytes` for `max_bytes`) and that `head`'s default differs in R",
      "(65535 rather than 102400). Contract 2 probes a Python session, so the",
      "Python spelling is the one that can be checked here."
    ]
  }
}
